# Authority of the Consuls: Bot2's Lingering Souls makes two Spirit tokens at once under Bot2. Tokens are creatures,
# so the two entering together trigger it twice (CR 603.2c): Bot1 gains 2 life. (That they enter tapped is the
# scenario next to this one.)
# Then Bot2 Disenchants the Authority; once it has left the battlefield Bot2's Ornithopter enters untapped and Bot1
# gains nothing more.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Authority of the Consuls
Plains x5
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Pearl
Mox Pearl
Lingering Souls
Disenchant
Ornithopter
Plains
Plains x13

