Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Life = 22
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#1.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#2.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Disenchant.Cast(Authority of the Consuls)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield = Plains
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass

